1
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,922
[YOUNGJAE] [SHINYU] [←YOUNGJAE]

2
00:00:06,638 --> 00:00:09,160
(YOUNGJAE) I think this is a good hiding spot

3
00:00:09,161 --> 00:00:11,616
I wonder if the other guys are okay

4
00:00:12,804 --> 00:00:15,407
(DOHOON) I think I'm really bad
at playing hide-and-seek

5
00:00:22,923 --> 00:00:25,201
19 minutes and 30 seconds? Okay

6
00:00:25,738 --> 00:00:32,229
[If he can't escape in 20 minutes
then he can't go out until the game ends]

7
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,328
[Phone alert] [JIHOON  →]

8
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:38,265
[One of your members is locked away]

9
00:00:38,541 --> 00:00:41,518
I'll go and set DOHOON free right away

10
00:00:41,519 --> 00:00:45,504
[← Prison] [JIHOON →]
(JIHOON) That's why I got a hiding spot
close to the prison

11
00:00:45,505 --> 00:00:49,507
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]
(HANJIN) It's so hot

12
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:58,015
Should we go out?

13
00:00:58,016 --> 00:00:59,089
Go out?

14
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:00,927
I think it'll be scary again outside

15
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,888
-Should we go?
-Yeah, let's go

16
00:01:03,889 --> 00:01:05,743
I'm so hot right now

17
00:01:05,744 --> 00:01:07,207
(HANJIN) I'll open it

18
00:01:08,834 --> 00:01:10,477
(HANJIN) It's so hot

19
00:01:32,034 --> 00:01:32,993
What's going on?

20
00:01:34,767 --> 00:01:36,096
Who is it?

21
00:01:37,011 --> 00:01:39,989
[Sound of the seeker's footsteps]

22
00:01:40,656 --> 00:01:41,535
Oh no

23
00:01:41,926 --> 00:01:43,861
Let's go inside the big refrigerator

24
00:01:43,862 --> 00:01:45,244
Come on

25
00:01:50,597 --> 00:01:51,589
KYUNGMIN

26
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:52,922
(HANJIN) Is it the seeker?

27
00:01:57,169 --> 00:01:59,496
I need the bathroom

28
00:02:02,326 --> 00:02:04,425
[← The other members' numbers]

29
00:02:08,378 --> 00:02:11,030
(DOHOON) I'll send them a text
instead of calling

30
00:02:11,428 --> 00:02:14,089
I'll leave in 15 minutes

31
00:02:14,658 --> 00:02:17,148
Luckily, I have a key that I found earlier

32
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:26,616
[YOUNGJAE  →]
(YOUNGJAE) I guess the seeker's not coming
here because I don't hear any footsteps

33
00:02:26,828 --> 00:02:28,943
I don't hear any footsteps

34
00:02:34,490 --> 00:02:38,623
[The seeker's footsteps] [JIHOON →]

35
00:02:41,177 --> 00:02:42,852
The seeker's coming

36
00:02:47,473 --> 00:02:50,531
[← JIHOON]

37
00:03:12,056 --> 00:03:14,512
[The seeker's footsteps fade away]

38
00:03:16,627 --> 00:03:20,450
Man, that was definitely the seeker for sure

39
00:03:22,467 --> 00:03:24,306
I survived

40
00:03:28,991 --> 00:03:33,905
[YOUNGJAE] [SHINYU] [Seeker]

41
00:03:33,906 --> 00:03:37,175
[SHINYU →]
(SHINYU) Hey

42
00:03:39,241 --> 00:03:41,600
Someone's coming

43
00:03:44,837 --> 00:03:48,839
[← YOUNGJAE]

44
00:03:49,035 --> 00:03:50,841
(YOUNGJAE) Please go!

45
00:03:53,671 --> 00:03:55,933
(JIHOON) How do I save DOHOON?

46
00:03:58,503 --> 00:04:00,716
(JIHOON) It's quiet out there now

47
00:04:03,416 --> 00:04:06,426
[JIHOON doesn't know DOHOON has a key]

48
00:04:07,305 --> 00:04:08,753
How did you know?

49
00:04:08,997 --> 00:04:09,957
Wait, don't open it now

50
00:04:09,958 --> 00:04:10,705
Why?

51
00:04:10,706 --> 00:04:12,705
-I want to escape 15 minutes later
-(JIHOON) Why?

52
00:04:12,706 --> 00:04:15,049
If you stay longer we don't know
what the survival rate will be like

53
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,871
I'll free DOHOON, thanks

54
00:04:17,619 --> 00:04:18,807
Isn't it too early, though?

55
00:04:18,808 --> 00:04:19,653
No, DOHOON, we should play harder

56
00:04:22,402 --> 00:04:24,599
[After setting DOHOON free,
he goes back to his spot]

57
00:04:25,672 --> 00:04:29,561
DOHOON's kicking up a fuss
even when I save him

58
00:04:32,131 --> 00:04:33,319
Whoo!

59
00:04:34,214 --> 00:04:37,191
[DOHOON escapes with JIHOON's key]

60
00:04:37,192 --> 00:04:40,152
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]

61
00:04:47,115 --> 00:04:49,588
(DOHOON) I'll never be found in here

62
00:04:56,486 --> 00:04:58,308
(DOHOON) Let me go in a bit deeper

63
00:05:00,358 --> 00:05:03,384
(DOHOON) It's blocked over here. This is it!

64
00:05:04,376 --> 00:05:06,589
If I hide here it's over

65
00:05:08,216 --> 00:05:10,510
I've found my final destination

66
00:05:11,551 --> 00:05:14,219
I'm so happy

67
00:05:17,131 --> 00:05:20,906
[← YOUNGJAE] [The seeker goes to the machine room]

68
00:05:21,914 --> 00:05:23,769
(YOUNGJAE) I'm so scared

69
00:05:24,111 --> 00:05:27,381
[← YOUNGJAE]

70
00:05:29,805 --> 00:05:32,831
[SHINYU →]

71
00:05:32,832 --> 00:05:35,678
[← SHINYU]

72
00:06:04,946 --> 00:06:08,086
[Found you, SHINYU!]

73
00:06:13,129 --> 00:06:16,376
(SHINYU) I'm sorry

74
00:06:17,066 --> 00:06:21,703
Oh man

75
00:06:24,403 --> 00:06:26,453
I thought I'd never be found

76
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:32,099
[← YOUNGJAE]

77
00:06:34,978 --> 00:06:38,313
(YOUNGJAE) I'll hang in there
like my life depends on it

78
00:06:38,314 --> 00:06:41,339
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]

79
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:44,577
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓] [Phone alert]

80
00:06:44,578 --> 00:06:46,350
I think one of the members got caught

81
00:06:46,351 --> 00:06:47,880
Come over here

82
00:06:59,073 --> 00:07:00,846
Let's stay here for now

83
00:07:01,415 --> 00:07:04,523
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN]

84
00:07:05,108 --> 00:07:08,265
If I escape
I'll hide really well

85
00:07:08,266 --> 00:07:10,005
Just one more chance

86
00:07:16,838 --> 00:07:18,807
(DOHOON) I will never get caught here

87
00:07:18,808 --> 00:07:20,336
[Phone alert]

88
00:07:20,483 --> 00:07:24,778
[Hint for a key]
It's another hint for a key

89
00:07:24,779 --> 00:07:26,860
I'm not going to look for it

90
00:07:26,861 --> 00:07:28,991
I'm going to stay hidden

91
00:07:28,992 --> 00:07:31,692
[Hint for a key]

92
00:07:32,165 --> 00:07:34,669
I have an extra key right now

93
00:07:35,564 --> 00:07:38,639
[JIHOON found one inside the manual forklift]

94
00:07:40,835 --> 00:07:42,901
Going somewhere else is...

95
00:07:50,271 --> 00:07:54,371
[Found the fourth key in the electric forklift]

96
00:07:55,868 --> 00:07:58,341
It's better if I use this one me

97
00:07:58,975 --> 00:08:01,741
[The seeker's footsteps]

98
00:08:03,026 --> 00:08:04,523
He's coming

99
00:08:04,524 --> 00:08:05,678
Turn off the lights

100
00:08:17,115 --> 00:08:20,320
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN] [Seeker]

101
00:08:26,014 --> 00:08:28,324
The key...

102
00:08:28,325 --> 00:08:29,837
What is this?

103
00:08:30,114 --> 00:08:32,278
[Finally spots the other members' numbers]

104
00:08:32,505 --> 00:08:34,067
I can't believe I saw this now

105
00:08:34,068 --> 00:08:35,483
I'm going crazy over here

106
00:08:35,484 --> 00:08:38,183
JIHOON said he had a key

107
00:08:39,729 --> 00:08:41,746
[Phone alert]

108
00:08:43,894 --> 00:08:45,488
Be quiet

109
00:08:45,911 --> 00:08:48,107
[Hey JIHOON, it's SHINYU.
I'm locked up. Please come and save me]

110
00:08:55,607 --> 00:08:58,568
[JIHOON uses his key on SHINYU]

111
00:09:01,692 --> 00:09:03,351
JIHOON?

112
00:09:04,392 --> 00:09:07,402
JIHOON!

113
00:09:13,731 --> 00:09:16,171
Oh no

114
00:09:16,172 --> 00:09:18,498
[SHINYU → JIHOON]
I don't have a key now anymore

115
00:09:18,499 --> 00:09:22,728
[SHINYU escapes the prison with JIHOON's key]

116
00:09:23,265 --> 00:09:25,428
[The seeker's footsteps come closer]

117
00:09:25,429 --> 00:09:26,502
Huh?

118
00:09:31,855 --> 00:09:33,758
I'm here again

119
00:09:34,978 --> 00:09:37,207
[SHINYU goes back into the machine room]

120
00:09:48,693 --> 00:09:49,832
Oh my gosh

121
00:09:55,494 --> 00:09:57,674
[A little wave]

122
00:10:02,473 --> 00:10:04,132
(YOUNGJAE) I got a fright

123
00:10:04,279 --> 00:10:06,052
Why am I here again?

124
00:10:06,475 --> 00:10:08,818
I'm done for. What do I do?

125
00:10:08,997 --> 00:10:11,649
(SHINYU) I feel so bad to JIHOON

126
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:18,351
I think this is the best place to hide

127
00:10:18,644 --> 00:10:21,800
[← SHINYU]
(SHINYU) This is the best place

128
00:10:21,801 --> 00:10:24,241
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]
The seeker's here!

129
00:10:24,242 --> 00:10:25,705
Sit down

130
00:10:27,869 --> 00:10:30,700
[The seeker ↓]
Turn off the light!

131
00:10:32,684 --> 00:10:34,230
[Sound of the seeker's footsteps]

132
00:10:38,802 --> 00:10:40,559
(HANJIN) Oh no...

133
00:10:43,894 --> 00:10:46,676
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]

134
00:10:50,662 --> 00:10:52,354
Please, please!

135
00:10:52,355 --> 00:10:53,476
Please

136
00:10:53,802 --> 00:10:58,910
[Sound of the seeker's footsteps]

137
00:11:04,175 --> 00:11:05,200
Is he gone?

138
00:11:12,456 --> 00:11:14,522
(HANJIN) No, he's still here

139
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:30,482
[Found you HANJIN and KYUNGMIN!]

140
00:11:30,483 --> 00:11:32,174
It's better to just get caught

141
00:11:32,175 --> 00:11:33,297
We got caught

142
00:11:33,298 --> 00:11:35,477
I lost my strength

143
00:11:35,802 --> 00:11:38,828
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]

144
00:11:39,137 --> 00:11:43,269
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN head to prison]
[JIHOON ↓]

145
00:11:43,432 --> 00:11:45,645
Oh no, why did so many of them get caught?

146
00:11:46,035 --> 00:11:48,524
Do I have to find more keys?

147
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:51,160
[Phone alert]

148
00:11:51,161 --> 00:11:53,340
[Two members have been caught]
Oh no

149
00:11:53,341 --> 00:11:54,820
(DOHOON) Shall I go?

150
00:11:54,821 --> 00:11:57,163
(DOHOON) Since I've already found this spot

151
00:11:57,358 --> 00:11:58,595
Who is that?

152
00:11:59,766 --> 00:12:02,140
[DOHOON and HANJIN who each have a key]
Hold on

153
00:12:02,532 --> 00:12:03,654
Shh!

154
00:12:05,980 --> 00:12:07,738
[The seeker's footsteps]

155
00:12:07,739 --> 00:12:09,951
[JIHOON ↓] [The seeker ↓]

156
00:12:10,505 --> 00:12:12,440
Oh no

157
00:12:24,788 --> 00:12:28,074
This is my opportunity
I have to go now

158
00:12:29,294 --> 00:12:31,556
If I don't go now, we're in trouble

159
00:12:32,809 --> 00:12:36,062
[Hint to the key]
A water bottle

160
00:12:36,063 --> 00:12:37,704
I need to find a water bottle

161
00:12:42,294 --> 00:12:44,148
I just need one key

162
00:12:45,824 --> 00:12:48,768
[Sound of the seeker approaching]

163
00:12:58,953 --> 00:13:00,466
Let me gain some time first

164
00:13:02,710 --> 00:13:04,582
[Phone alert]

165
00:13:05,574 --> 00:13:07,608
That made me jump!

166
00:13:09,349 --> 00:13:10,406
[Phone alert]

167
00:13:10,407 --> 00:13:11,903
We got a text

168
00:13:12,293 --> 00:13:15,157
In a little while

169
00:13:15,158 --> 00:13:19,566
[When there's 2,222 seconds left,
the seeker will disappear for a while]

170
00:13:20,037 --> 00:13:24,593
you will have four minutes
to really hide yourselves

171
00:13:25,259 --> 00:13:28,400
[After four minutes, there will be two seekers
so hide even better]

172
00:13:28,741 --> 00:13:30,482
How many seconds are left?

173
00:13:30,483 --> 00:13:31,523
The time's over there

174
00:13:31,524 --> 00:13:32,890
I see it now

175
00:13:32,891 --> 00:13:34,061
DOHOON, should we go out now?

176
00:13:35,021 --> 00:13:38,161
[← DOHOON]
The seeker's in front over there

177
00:13:58,953 --> 00:14:01,003
[The seeker disappears for a while]

178
00:14:01,199 --> 00:14:03,362
[TWS has four minutes of freedom]

179
00:14:05,916 --> 00:14:07,120
Save me!

180
00:14:07,429 --> 00:14:09,007
[HANJIN escapes from prison]

181
00:14:09,236 --> 00:14:10,552
I'll set him free

182
00:14:11,008 --> 00:14:13,595
[KYUNGMIN escapes from prison with DOHOON's key]

183
00:14:14,083 --> 00:14:16,198
It's four minutes starting now, right?

184
00:14:19,566 --> 00:14:21,306
Having two seekers is horrifying

185
00:14:21,794 --> 00:14:23,193
[JIHOON →]
Hey! Anyone with a key?

186
00:14:23,194 --> 00:14:24,864
I don't! That's why I'm looking for it

187
00:14:25,439 --> 00:14:26,887
[Hint for the key]
We need to find a blue garbage can

188
00:14:26,888 --> 00:14:28,286
There's a blue garbage can here

189
00:14:28,287 --> 00:14:29,896
but there're no keys

190
00:14:29,897 --> 00:14:31,815
(JIHOON) It'd have been nice if it was here

191
00:14:31,816 --> 00:14:33,703
but unfortunately it's not here

192
00:14:34,256 --> 00:14:36,079
A blue garbage can

193
00:14:36,225 --> 00:14:37,819
A blue garbage can

194
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:40,487
[← SHINYU]

195
00:14:40,731 --> 00:14:43,253
I'll never get caught

196
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:48,492
[SHINYU stays hidden]

197
00:14:48,964 --> 00:14:53,063
[YOUNGJAE also stays hidden]

198
00:14:54,087 --> 00:14:56,203
[He's even blocked out the light]

199
00:14:57,050 --> 00:14:58,725
But we really need a key

200
00:14:58,969 --> 00:15:01,165
[Lost a key in the seeker box]
[TWS has already used up all four keys]

201
00:15:01,442 --> 00:15:03,313
We have to find a key

202
00:15:04,029 --> 00:15:06,908
I don't have time to walk around

203
00:15:06,909 --> 00:15:08,177
I have to run

204
00:15:11,057 --> 00:15:12,912
They say it's right under your nose

205
00:15:13,611 --> 00:15:14,896
but I really can't see it

206
00:15:21,632 --> 00:15:23,372
A blue trash can

207
00:15:24,528 --> 00:15:26,464
Is it this one?

208
00:15:30,417 --> 00:15:32,743
[HANJIN finds the fifth key in the movable trash can]

209
00:15:33,037 --> 00:15:35,525
[An alert that the seekers are reappearing]

210
00:15:38,259 --> 00:15:40,422
Oh no, it's starting

211
00:15:54,772 --> 00:15:59,506
Ready or not

212
00:15:59,507 --> 00:16:03,378
here I come

213
00:16:18,817 --> 00:16:21,567
[HANJIN is breathing hard]

214
00:16:22,575 --> 00:16:26,594
Ready or not

215
00:16:26,595 --> 00:16:28,546
I couldn't find the key

216
00:16:28,547 --> 00:16:32,890
here I come

217
00:16:33,443 --> 00:16:36,111
(DOHOON) I'm going back
to my hiding spot from earlier

218
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:38,389
JIHOON, let's hide together

219
00:16:38,390 --> 00:16:40,016
Hide somewhere close to me

220
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:42,196
I'm so scared

221
00:16:47,174 --> 00:16:51,615
[JIHOON is making a double-layered shield]

222
00:16:51,616 --> 00:16:55,585
[← KYUNGMIN] [KYUNGMIN pacing alone]

223
00:16:56,496 --> 00:16:58,936
[Hides between two boxes]

224
00:17:02,044 --> 00:17:06,534
Ready or not

225
00:17:07,657 --> 00:17:11,935
here come two seekers

226
00:17:14,115 --> 00:17:16,328
Are you all hiding?

227
00:17:17,173 --> 00:17:21,176
Here we come

228
00:17:26,968 --> 00:17:29,392
(DOHOON) I'll never get caught here

229
00:17:29,555 --> 00:17:32,678
[DOHOON]

230
00:17:32,679 --> 00:17:35,070
(DOHOON) Wow, this is literally
the best hiding spot

231
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:38,275
(DOHOON) Nobody can find me here

232
00:17:38,665 --> 00:17:40,097
I will never get caught here

233
00:17:40,098 --> 00:17:42,440
(DOHOON) Nobody can come in here

234
00:17:42,441 --> 00:17:45,872
[← SHINYU] [YOUNGJAE] [SHINYU]
(SHINYU) I won't be found here for sure!

235
00:17:46,735 --> 00:17:51,079
I mean honestly
there's nothing to do it

236
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:54,365
I just have to hide where nobody can find me

237
00:17:54,366 --> 00:17:57,212
They will never find me

238
00:17:57,213 --> 00:17:59,880
[Laughs]

239
00:18:00,515 --> 00:18:05,281
[HANJIN ↓] [HANJIN]
(HANJIN) This is so hard

240
00:18:05,282 --> 00:18:06,876
[The seeker's footsteps come closer]

241
00:18:06,877 --> 00:18:08,616
They're here

242
00:18:10,813 --> 00:18:15,222
[HANJIN] [Seeker]

243
00:18:19,143 --> 00:18:24,072
[The seeker searches for the members
even harder than before]

244
00:18:24,853 --> 00:18:28,513
It's so scary being here alone

245
00:18:30,921 --> 00:18:36,176
[The seeker searches every corner
of the warehouse]

246
00:18:40,162 --> 00:18:44,734
[The seeker and HANJIN get further apart]

247
00:18:45,515 --> 00:18:47,320
I didn't manage to find the key in the end

248
00:18:47,321 --> 00:18:49,647
[JIHOON doesn't know HANJIN has found it]

249
00:18:49,648 --> 00:18:51,550
I'm sorry guys

250
00:18:51,811 --> 00:18:54,772
I've wrapped myself up really tight

251
00:18:54,773 --> 00:18:56,968
As you can see from the front

252
00:18:56,969 --> 00:18:59,083
[JIHOON ↓]
(JIHOON) I'm going to survive no matter what

253
00:18:59,084 --> 00:19:01,140
[JIHOON and KYUNGMIN] [KYUNGMIN←]

254
00:19:01,101 --> 00:19:03,020
(KYUNGMIN) I'm hiding right now

255
00:19:03,817 --> 00:19:07,331
but there are now two seekers

256
00:19:09,039 --> 00:19:11,106
and we haven't found the key

257
00:19:11,107 --> 00:19:13,152
[The seeker's footsteps draw closer]

258
00:19:13,823 --> 00:19:15,384
They're coming

259
00:19:15,791 --> 00:19:19,094
[Another seeker appears]

260
00:19:19,095 --> 00:19:22,917
[← JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN →]

261
00:19:26,708 --> 00:19:28,627
[Lights out]

262
00:19:28,628 --> 00:19:32,125
Please don't come over here

263
00:19:41,089 --> 00:19:45,184
[← KYUNGMIN] [← JIHOON]

264
00:19:45,125 --> 00:19:48,785
[KYUNGMIN's CAM]

265
00:19:50,346 --> 00:19:55,943
[Phone rings]

266
00:19:59,359 --> 00:20:00,840
What the...

267
00:20:00,841 --> 00:20:05,005
[← KYUNGMIN] [← JIHOON]
[The seeker's tracking the sound]

268
00:20:05,006 --> 00:20:08,649
[JIHOON's breathing]

269
00:20:16,702 --> 00:20:20,542
[KYUNGMIN's CAM] [The seeker →]

270
00:20:27,456 --> 00:20:30,954
[I found you KYUNGMIN!]

271
00:20:31,897 --> 00:20:34,208
Let's go

272
00:20:35,867 --> 00:20:37,819
We don't even have a key

273
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:41,317
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]

274
00:20:42,082 --> 00:20:44,311
Who called me!

275
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:47,662
Let me call them

276
00:20:50,411 --> 00:20:53,698
[DOHOON was the one who called JIHOON]

277
00:20:53,813 --> 00:20:54,999
Did you find the key?

278
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,398
No I didn't

279
00:20:56,399 --> 00:20:57,667
Where are you hiding?

280
00:20:57,781 --> 00:21:00,466
I was hiding close to KYUNGMIN

281
00:21:00,467 --> 00:21:01,718
but KYUNGMIN got caught

282
00:21:01,719 --> 00:21:03,297
(DOHOON) He got caught? Oh no...

283
00:21:05,070 --> 00:21:07,152
He called me over nothing

284
00:21:07,591 --> 00:21:11,252
[KYUNGMIN got caught instead of JIHOON
whose phone rang]

285
00:21:11,253 --> 00:21:15,140
[← SHINYU] [Phone vibrates]

286
00:21:18,964 --> 00:21:20,444
Hello?

287
00:21:20,851 --> 00:21:22,299
SHINYU, where are you?

288
00:21:22,300 --> 00:21:25,699
I'm somewhere nobody can find me

289
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:27,749
-Are you hiding?
-(SHINYU) Yeah

290
00:21:27,750 --> 00:21:29,652
-Did you find the key?
-(SHINYU) No

291
00:21:30,449 --> 00:21:31,702
(SHINYU) Where are you?

292
00:21:31,703 --> 00:21:32,987
(KYUNGMIN) In prison

293
00:21:32,988 --> 00:21:34,565
-(SHINYU) In prison?
-(KYUNGMIN) Yeah

294
00:21:34,566 --> 00:21:36,615
(SHINYU) Okay, I'll win this for us

295
00:21:36,616 --> 00:21:39,039
-You're going to win this?
-(SHINYU) Yeah

296
00:21:39,349 --> 00:21:42,293
-Okay SHINYU, but you can't set me free?
-Yeah

297
00:21:43,009 --> 00:21:44,620
-Okay
-Yeah

298
00:21:44,621 --> 00:21:45,384
[Laughs]

299
00:21:51,062 --> 00:21:52,201
Everyone's hiding

300
00:21:52,901 --> 00:21:54,934
[HANJIN↓]

301
00:21:54,935 --> 00:21:56,220
(HANJIN) Well

302
00:21:56,919 --> 00:21:59,952
in October, for our fourth mini album

303
00:22:00,051 --> 00:22:02,036
when we do our comeback

304
00:22:02,037 --> 00:22:05,176
we'd be grateful for all your love

305
00:22:05,778 --> 00:22:11,635
[The seeker appears while HANJIN is promoting]

306
00:22:11,636 --> 00:22:14,368
There are lots of amazing songs

307
00:22:14,369 --> 00:22:16,743
[The seeker's footsteps are coming closer]

308
00:22:16,744 --> 00:22:19,525
in the album
so please give it a listen

309
00:22:20,648 --> 00:22:23,007
[The seeker's footsteps]

310
00:22:23,316 --> 00:22:25,561
[Gulping sound]

311
00:22:31,889 --> 00:22:35,192
[← HANJIN] [← Seeker]

312
00:22:39,438 --> 00:22:43,863
[← HANJIN] [The seeker goes closer to HANJIN]

313
00:22:43,864 --> 00:22:46,190
[The seeker walks past]

314
00:22:57,171 --> 00:23:00,149
[and the footsteps fade away]

315
00:23:02,996 --> 00:23:06,022
[But just then]

316
00:23:17,133 --> 00:23:20,696
[Phone vibrates]

317
00:23:20,697 --> 00:23:24,633
[The seeker heads toward the sound]

318
00:23:40,219 --> 00:23:41,195
(HANJIN) Hold on please

319
00:23:41,196 --> 00:23:45,669
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]
(HANJIN) I just got a call from someone

320
00:23:46,239 --> 00:23:48,451
(SHINYU) How much time is left?

321
00:23:49,882 --> 00:23:51,965
They'll never find me here

322
00:23:53,803 --> 00:23:56,927
[The seeker appears right away]

323
00:23:56,928 --> 00:23:59,840
[← YOUNGJAE] [SHINYU →]

324
00:24:00,751 --> 00:24:02,573
(SHINYU) He's coming

325
00:24:27,676 --> 00:24:32,670
[The seeker's coming closer and closer]

326
00:24:56,683 --> 00:25:00,279
[Found you YOUNGJAE!]

327
00:25:00,653 --> 00:25:02,231
I got caught

328
00:25:02,232 --> 00:25:05,127
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]
(YOUNGJAE) Oh man...

329
00:25:05,128 --> 00:25:07,584
But did you find the key?

330
00:25:11,228 --> 00:25:13,749
I'll escape now

331
00:25:13,750 --> 00:25:15,539
-Don't leave
-Why?

332
00:25:15,702 --> 00:25:17,231
-There are three of us still out there
-Yeah

333
00:25:17,232 --> 00:25:18,728
There are still three left
but if you...

334
00:25:18,729 --> 00:25:22,795
Guys, I got caught...

335
00:25:25,137 --> 00:25:27,692
We just need half of us to survive

336
00:25:28,180 --> 00:25:30,035
Won't we all be able to survive if I go out?

337
00:25:30,036 --> 00:25:31,157
(KYUNGMIN) No, I mean

338
00:25:31,158 --> 00:25:33,728
(KYUNGMIN) HANJIN, you need to escape
when we're nearly finished to win

339
00:25:33,729 --> 00:25:34,232
Really?

340
00:25:34,233 --> 00:25:37,128
-Fifty percent of us
-We need at least three to succeed

341
00:25:37,129 --> 00:25:38,527
Right now, three of us are
hiding in really good spots

342
00:25:38,528 --> 00:25:41,016
[JIHOON ↓]
(JIHOON) Logically, right now

343
00:25:41,423 --> 00:25:44,465
even if I did have the key
I can't go to the prison

344
00:25:45,685 --> 00:25:49,362
It's a challenge after a challenge.
Finding the key is difficult

345
00:25:49,363 --> 00:25:51,477
and taking the key
and going to the prison is difficult too

346
00:25:52,437 --> 00:25:56,390
[TWS's survival rate is 50% and one key left]

347
00:25:56,391 --> 00:25:58,571
This is fine

348
00:25:59,433 --> 00:26:02,247
It's been a long time being able to
spend time like this

349
00:26:02,719 --> 00:26:04,720
[Phone alert]

350
00:26:05,127 --> 00:26:09,210
[There are 444 seconds left]
Even faster than the seekers
are their shadows, who're on the move now

351
00:26:09,211 --> 00:26:11,358
If you get caught by a shadow, there'll be

352
00:26:11,359 --> 00:26:13,001
[a siren sound so don't ever get caught]

353
00:26:13,002 --> 00:26:14,807
They'll never find me here

354
00:26:15,376 --> 00:26:19,346
[← JIHOON]
(JIHOON) Shadows...
are apparently coming

355
00:26:19,347 --> 00:26:21,347
I need to stay silent

356
00:26:22,876 --> 00:26:26,992
Will TWS be able to get the presents for 42?

357
00:26:32,328 --> 00:26:35,387
[At 444 seconds, something comes out]

358
00:26:38,706 --> 00:26:42,334
[The shadows begin to move]

359
00:26:42,660 --> 00:26:44,156
What's going on?

360
00:26:47,459 --> 00:26:51,038
[← JIHOON]
[Enters the area where JIHOON's hiding]

361
00:26:55,024 --> 00:27:00,311
[← JIHOON] [Are the shadows
heading toward him?]

362
00:27:00,913 --> 00:27:01,971
They're coming

363
00:27:01,972 --> 00:27:04,411
[JIHOON →]

364
00:27:12,805 --> 00:27:16,124
[Searches carefully among the boxes]

365
00:27:24,438 --> 00:27:29,921
[but fails to find JIHOON and leaves]

366
00:27:31,466 --> 00:27:33,744
I nearly almost got caught

367
00:27:33,745 --> 00:27:36,005
I can't lift my head

368
00:27:36,006 --> 00:27:39,292
[JIHOON sighs]

369
00:27:39,293 --> 00:27:43,180
[←SHINYU]

370
00:27:47,556 --> 00:27:50,013
What's going on!

371
00:27:50,014 --> 00:27:52,340
[SHINYU →] [A shadow enters
the machine room]

372
00:27:54,975 --> 00:27:57,562
[The shadow draws closer]

373
00:28:00,018 --> 00:28:01,971
[Shadow's CAM]

374
00:28:01,972 --> 00:28:03,191
[← SHINYU] [← Shadow]

375
00:28:03,615 --> 00:28:06,412
[Goes closer to SHINYU]

376
00:28:06,413 --> 00:28:09,764
[Shadow's CAM] [SHINYU →]

377
00:28:17,556 --> 00:28:20,550
[The shadow doesn't see SHINYU in the dark]

378
00:28:21,933 --> 00:28:23,918
(SHINYU) What did I tell you?

379
00:28:23,919 --> 00:28:26,439
(SHINYU) I'm not weak

380
00:28:30,458 --> 00:28:33,175
[Alert that 20 minutes are up]

381
00:28:33,176 --> 00:28:34,053
(YOUNGJAE) I think KYUNGMIN's out

382
00:28:34,054 --> 00:28:35,321
(HANJIN) KYUNGMIN's out now

383
00:28:35,322 --> 00:28:37,941
[KYUNGMIN can escape now that 20 minutes are up]

384
00:28:37,942 --> 00:28:41,407
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]

385
00:28:41,635 --> 00:28:44,059
Gatekeeper, can you come here?

386
00:28:44,856 --> 00:28:47,003
Come slowly, please!

387
00:28:47,947 --> 00:28:50,322
Hold on

388
00:28:50,323 --> 00:28:54,178
Can I have a second to think about it?

389
00:28:56,407 --> 00:29:00,084
[There are 200 seconds left]

390
00:29:02,914 --> 00:29:05,778
[Sound of the shadows] [← DOHOON]

391
00:29:06,509 --> 00:29:08,690
They're here

392
00:29:12,171 --> 00:29:17,394
[Shadow's CAM]

393
00:29:17,898 --> 00:29:20,322
[Lights out]

394
00:29:24,910 --> 00:29:27,318
Please...

395
00:29:34,444 --> 00:29:39,568
[Shadow's CAM] [Doesn't spot DOHOON in the dark]

396
00:29:44,888 --> 00:29:46,483
[The shadow goes away]

397
00:29:46,972 --> 00:29:48,386
I have one minute left

398
00:29:48,647 --> 00:29:52,665
[Only one minute left]

399
00:29:52,666 --> 00:29:55,626
[← JIHOON] [The shadows are moving faster]

400
00:29:55,627 --> 00:29:57,367
(JIHOON) Are they back?

401
00:29:57,368 --> 00:29:58,977
The're back again?

402
00:29:59,823 --> 00:30:03,467
[The seekers are getting faster now]

403
00:30:10,804 --> 00:30:12,448
There's 30 seconds left

404
00:30:12,449 --> 00:30:13,863
Getting ready to escape

405
00:30:21,266 --> 00:30:22,925
Can you come over here please?

406
00:30:23,007 --> 00:30:25,951
[Only ten seconds left]

407
00:30:34,541 --> 00:30:39,357
[HANJIN escapes from prison]

408
00:30:40,902 --> 00:30:43,961
[Hide-and-seek ends]

409
00:30:45,035 --> 00:30:49,183
I give up, where are you?

410
00:30:49,867 --> 00:30:53,007
It's over

411
00:30:54,845 --> 00:30:59,140
I give up, where are you?

412
00:31:04,264 --> 00:31:06,233
(SHINYU) Wait, is it over?

413
00:31:06,396 --> 00:31:08,722
Is it over?

414
00:31:08,723 --> 00:31:10,317
[Phone alert]

415
00:31:10,675 --> 00:31:11,635
It's over now

416
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:18,484
[The hide-and-seek game is over now.
Come to the prison to check the survival rate]

417
00:31:21,330 --> 00:31:23,674
[TWS wins with a final survival rate of 66.7%]

418
00:31:23,675 --> 00:31:25,884
-Did you survive?
-Yeah, I came out with 10 seconds left

419
00:31:26,960 --> 00:31:31,418
[All the survivors come to the prison]

420
00:31:31,419 --> 00:31:33,061
I didn't see the seeker even once

421
00:31:33,062 --> 00:31:34,395
-Where were you?
-Where were you hiding?

422
00:31:34,396 --> 00:31:35,989
Did you see where I was hiding?

423
00:31:35,990 --> 00:31:36,949
-(KYUNGMIN) Is that where you were?
-Yeah

424
00:31:36,950 --> 00:31:37,795
-(KYUNGMIN) Were you there the whole time?
-Yeah

425
00:31:37,796 --> 00:31:40,284
I was in the best hiding spot over

426
00:31:40,285 --> 00:31:42,106
I found a spot where there were no cameras

427
00:31:42,107 --> 00:31:44,059
Where? There's a spot like that?

428
00:31:44,060 --> 00:31:46,483
I was hiding somewhere
they’d never find me too

429
00:31:46,484 --> 00:31:48,240
[Phone alert]

430
00:31:48,241 --> 00:31:51,754
[Hide-and-seek is over and survival rate is over 50%]
so 42 gets snack treats

431
00:31:51,998 --> 00:31:52,925
I was literally

432
00:31:52,926 --> 00:31:54,454
holding my breath so I could get 42 presents!

433
00:31:54,455 --> 00:31:56,716
-I really did my best
-For real

434
00:31:56,717 --> 00:31:58,359
[The seeker's scream]

435
00:32:01,613 --> 00:32:04,427
Don't you dare look back!
